BatmanTunnel 0.2.0

Based on BackPack by Amin Mohammadi (AminMGMT)
https://github.com/AminMGMT/BackPack

Native engine source: BackPack v1.8.5, commit ff86354 (full commit recorded in engine/UPSTREAM_COMMIT).
